    run in the full tier as EF suite "compensation" (containerSuites in tools/ci/test-tiers.json). The subset and the host are the
    ones Elsa.Activities.Compensation.Tests runs on SQLite on every pull request, linked rather than copied, so the
    server providers prove exactly the journeys the SQLite matrix proves.
